  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2080736,
    "UIName": "Wolverine",
    "Id": "chassisdef_wolverine_WVR-QS1",
    "Name": "Wolverine",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Medium Missile Sniper. The WVR-QS1 has devastating firepower, in the form of Quicsell exclusive deadfire ammunition for a Thunderbolt 15 and a Thunderbolt 20. So long as you conserve your ammunition, you should be able to totally destroy several mechs of equivalent tonnage.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>",
